rowhammer (0.35.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add --reset config|stats|highscore|save|all (ROWHAMMER_RESET): delete
    persistent data in the data directory and exit instead of starting
    the game. "config" removes rowhammer.conf, "stats" the statistics,
    "highscore" both highscore lists (highscore and highscore-ultra),
    "save" the savegame with the wonder progress and "all" every one of
    them.
  * Ask before deleting on a terminal: the affected paths are listed
    first and the question defaults to no, like the in-game confirmation
    does. Without a tty (scripting, CI) the reset runs right away, since
    a waiting prompt would hang the caller. Files that are already gone
    are reported but are not an error.
  * Move the tty check below the library modules so a reset also works
    without a terminal; the game itself still requires one.

